    "Loop is having trouble communicating with your FreeStyle Libre 3 sensor. CGM readings may pause briefly and should resume automatically. No action is needed unless this keeps happening." : {
      "comment" : "Sensor check alert body (transient transmission error)",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Loop heeft moeite om te communiceren met je FreeStyle Libre 3-sensor. CGM-metingen kunnen even pauzeren en zouden vanzelf moeten hervatten. Je hoeft niets te doen, tenzij dit blijft gebeuren."
